# Session-log nest lens

When the nest, stub, or packer are in context:

- Append to the **latest shard** (or create `YYYY-MM-DD__topic-slug.md`) — never grow the stub `docs/process/session-log.md`.
- Shard budget **≤225 lines**; filename = date-first span + lead-title kebab slug.
- Chronology SoT for re-reads = `docs/process/session-log/.pack-order` (not `ls` alpha).
- After a manual append: `python3 scripts/process/pack_session_log.py --index-only`.
- Bulk rebuild only: `python3 scripts/process/pack_session_log.py --from-git HEAD:docs/process/session-log.md`.
- **Refuse:** chat dumps as research SoT; rewriting history; month/week-only splits; mass `.md`→`.mdc` of shards.

